  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『──普段はユニットで活動されているんですよね』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、『放課後クライマックスガールズ』という\r\nユニットで活動しています",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『──どうして今のユニットで\r\n活動することになったんですか？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "オーディションを受けて２８３プロダクションに所属して\r\nユニットを組むことになりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『──ユニットでは最年長とのことですが\r\nユニット内ではどんな役割ですか？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………ふふ、そうね\r\n年長者だからこそ正しい姿を見せたいとは思うけれど",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "年長者だからといって優れているというわけでは\r\nないので、お互いに学ぶことが多いです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私の役割で言えば……みんなを盛り上げて\r\nユニットの士気を上げることかしら",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『──今回はひとりでの挑戦ですが\r\n普段とどう違いますか？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………\r\nあまり変わらないんじゃないかしら",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ソロだろうとユニットだろうと、\r\n私がトップを目指すことには変わりないから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……だけど少し寂しいかもしれないわね\r\nいつも一緒のメンバーがいないのは",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『──ユニットと個人、\r\nどちらが実力を発揮できると思いますか？』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ユニットでは見せられなかった姿を\r\nみんなに見せたいと思っているし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "オーディションを通して努力して\r\n成長していく過程も見てもらえたらと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『──今回のオーディションでの\r\n目標を聞かせて下さい』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………\r\n製作発表でもお話させていただいたとおりで",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──当然、目指すのはトップだけ\r\n『G.R.A.D.』優勝です",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私を信じて、応援してください\r\n──絶対に後悔させないわ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020140"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
