  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──夏葉、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサー！\r\nどうだったかしら？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "おかしなところ、なかった？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……それならよかったわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "強いて言えば、今日の夏葉は\r\nいつもより慎重な感じがしたかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごく……言葉を選んで\r\n話しているように見えたから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……夏葉、製作発表のステージで言ったこと\r\n後悔してるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『優勝宣言』なんて、ネットニュースになったからさ\r\n色んな反響があっただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい意味でも、その反対の意味でも\r\n注目されることになったと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうね……後悔はしてないわよ\r\nだけど言い回しには気を付けたほうがいいかと思って",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……少し、慎重になっていたかもしれないわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私らしくありたいけど、\r\n誰かを不快にしたいわけじゃないの",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nあれから、少し考えてたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉が言ったとおり、目標を口に出すことも\r\nそこに向かって一生懸命に努力することも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かっこいいことのはずなのに、\r\nそういうのを良しとしない雰囲気って、あるよなぁって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………ええ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020240"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、目標を口に出して、\r\nそこに向かって一生懸命に努力するっていう……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それをいつも当たり前にやってる夏葉は\r\nやっぱりすごくかっこいいし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉がいつも正しくいられること……\r\nいや、いつも正しくあろうといられること、かな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうところは、夏葉の魅力だと思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020250,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……アナタがそう言ってくれるなら\r\n間違いないわね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが、このオーディションを通して\r\nもっとみんなに伝わればいいなと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003020260,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………\r\n伝えられるように、頑張らないとね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300302/1013003020260"
  },
